  "overview": "Our group studies the molecular mechanisms that control the metabolic processes critical for sustaining cancer cell growth and proliferation, with a focus on the childhood cancer neuroblastoma. We investigate how cancer cells increase the production of building blocks for the synthesis of macromolecules for cell growth and proliferation, which may direct the development of new cancer therapeutics designed to target vulnerabilities of cancer cells.",
